       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. POUPA1.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SALDO            PIC S9(13)V99 VALUE 8432,17.
       01  WS-TAXA             PIC S9V9(6)   VALUE 0,005.
       01  WS-RENDIMENTO       PIC S9(13)V99.
       01  WS-ED-VALOR         PIC -.---.---.---.--9,99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE WS-RENDIMENTO ROUNDED = WS-SALDO * WS-TAXA
